  "headline": "God of War Ragnarok late-mid walkthrough (Missions 9-13): spear confirms, short runics, and upgrade timing",
  "description": "A repeatable 3-weapon loop for missions 9-13: spear throw/detonate confirms, Axe single-target control, Blades crowd suppression",
