  ],
  "articleBody": "Scope: The Path missions 9-13. This is where consistency matters most: lock a 3-weapon role split and win with safe confirms instead of long strings.\n\n1) Goals\n- Use spear throw + detonate as guaranteed damage confirms\n- Axe for single-target control, Blades for camera and crowd stability\n- Upgrade before you feel stuck; level gaps are the real difficulty spikes\n\n2) Skill priorities\n- Spear: confirm damage with throw/detonate, then reset\n- Axe: short, reliable hits\n- Blades: pull/AoE control for multi-target fights\n- Shield: improve punish windows for your defense style\n\n3) Gear roles\n- Stability: removes failure modes\n- Rotation: short runics to create more safe windows\n\n4) Steps\n1) keep weapon levels close\n2) swap long runics for short landable ones\n3) learn 3 punish windows per boss\n\nRelated: use the hub to jump to boss and endgame pages.",
